cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper and this archived release."
title: "ConformalGoCo (GoCo): co-essentiality-guided conformal calibration for Gene Ontology annotation release"
abstract: "Reference implementation, frozen inputs and split-level results for GoCo, a calibration and release layer that certifies a gene-level false discovery proportion for predicted Gene Ontology annotations without retraining the upstream predictor."
type: software
version: 2.3.0
license: MIT
